{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmfc87nZy4LGcAcrzwDy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Short version: I'd join. Fairly sure. What decided it was the chart. Over 5 years I put in 45,000 ₪ and the employer puts in +135,000 ₪, and even after the minus I still end up with about 136,457 ₪. My own money basically triples. I'd tell HR yes and leave the money in for 6 years.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- **Top of the page:** \"קרן השתלמות\" and the first line under it. Got the idea that the employer and I both put money in, and after 6 years I can take it out without tax.\n- **\"למה משתמשים בזה\":** looked at the bubbles under it, didn't read them.\n- **The \"כמה כסף נשאר לכם, ומתי?\" box:** \"שכירים\" was already picked. I never actually saw the field where my 30,000 went; it was somewhere between two screens. I saw \"תשואה בשנה 7\" and \"דמי ניהול 0.54\".\n- **The chart, \"מושכים את הכסף אחרי 5 שנים\":**\n  - The line under it: \"750 ₪ בחודש מכם, 2,250 ₪ מהמעסיק\". So I put in 750 and the boss puts in 2,250 a month. That's what clicked.\n  - The numbers on the bars, left to right: 45,000 ₪, +135,000 ₪, then +21,218 ₪, which I guess is profit, the teal bit. Then −64,761 ₪ in a pink striped box. I'm guessing that's tax, because above the chart it says \"לפני 6 שנים: מס\". Last bar: 136,457 ₪.\n  - I didn't move the year marker. It was on 5.\n- **Bottom of the chart box:** saw \"בין 19 המסלולים... 135,908 ₪ ... 137,668 ₪\", so whatever track I pick it's about the same money. Didn't read the grey lines under that.\n- **Rest of the page:** scrolled past \"שווה לדעת\", \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\" (saw the names Harel and Altshuler Shaham, I know those) and \"כמה זה עולה\" (\"עד 2% בשנה\"). Then \"מיסוי\", where an orange warning box made me nervous, but I only read \"משיכה לפני הזמן אפשרית, אבל יקרה\". Stopped at \"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\". That's where I'd have closed it.\n\n**What I wasn't sure about:**\n- That −64,761 really scared me. Is it tax for taking the money out before 6 years? Then don't take it out at 5. I'd keep the money in.\n- My take-home is 9,500 and I entered 30,000. I didn't check the 750 and 2,250 against anything.\n- Something said \"על שכר של עד 15,712 ₪ בחודש\". No idea if that changes my numbers.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"מסלול מדד\", \"תקרה\", \"הפקדה מוטבת\", \"משכורת קובעת\", \"הרווח הריאלי\", \"נאמנות\", \"מס רווחי הון\".\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- I never saw where my salary went in. It was cut off between screens.\n- Year 5 was already selected, and that's exactly the year with the big tax hit. Why start there?\n- It's 45,000 + 135,000 and I end up with 136,457. That looks like I lose a lot, and it's only explained in a box I didn't read.\n- There's a big minus number in pink stripes and no word on the bar saying what it is."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3963,"cache_read_input_tokens":13597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3963},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0928cc1-ea54-4249-84c3-3f4837a0f072","uuid":"896885fc-9f09-4b6e-82b4-091df4bee780","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:22:30.966Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmfc7hjKQWwHEEWwLmMs"}
